    ins "跟上浪！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1500
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_d18b4a3c:

    # zo "Hngn... Come on..."
    zo "嗯……加油……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1502
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_06f19518:

    # ins "You got it, Zoey! Pop up when you're ready for it!"
    ins "就是这样，Zoey！准备好就起身！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1508
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_3bf705fe:

    # zo "Whoa!"
    zo "哇！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1513
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_c7c8ef34:

    # ins "That was a nice try, Zoey, but you need to go slower and lower with your pop up."
    ins "刚才试得不错，Zoey，但你的起身动作得更慢，重心也要更低。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1515
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_f62a761c:

    # zo "How?"
    zo "怎么做？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1517
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_a241e430:

    # ins "Go to the prone position first and catch your balance before completing the pop up."
    ins "先回到俯卧姿势，稳住平衡后再完成起身。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1518
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_34b5ce7a:

    # ins "And when you're standing up, stand with a lower stance so you don't lose your balance. You were standing kind of straight."
    ins "站起来的时候，重心要放低点，别一不小心就失去平衡。你刚才站得有点直。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1520
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_61cc5bf3:

    # zo "{i}I don't remember how many tries it took... Some say that going from wakeboarding to surfing is easy...{/i}"
    zo "{i}我不记得试了多少次……有人说从尾波滑水转到冲浪很容易……{/i}"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1521
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_1c0604c1:

    # zo "{i}But from skateboarding to surfing... Not so much. At least not for me.{/i}"
    zo "{i}但从滑板转到冲浪……可不轻松。至少我不行。{/i}"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1523
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_308f3518:

    # zo "{i}Seeing how others managed to surf within a couple of attempts didn't boost my confidence.{/i}"
    zo "{i}看到别人几次尝试就学会了冲浪，这并没有提升我的信心。{/i}"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1525
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_142a3002:

    # zo "{i}It just got me frustrated. Fuck! I was supposed to be good at this.{/i}"
    zo "{i}只会让我更窝火。操！我本来应该很擅长才对。{/i}"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1526
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_631195f8:

    # zo "{i}It's like learning how to walk all over again.{/i}"
    zo "{i}就像重新学会走路一样。{/i}"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1529
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_e66c5123:

    # zo "Ugh!"
    zo "唔！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1531
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_259028df:

    # em "You are fuming. Did it get to ya?"
    em "你都快冒烟了。受打击了？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1536
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_6ebc0c5c:

    # zo "I'm fine..."
    zo "我没事……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1538
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_9345739d:

    # em "That would be easier to believe if I couldn't hear your teeth grinding."
    em "要不是能听见你磨牙，这话或许还可信点。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1540
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_4c3e3fcc:

    # zo "I don't know what happened out there. I have great balance..."
    zo "我不知道刚才在海里怎么回事。我的平衡感明明很好……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1544
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_79675d95:

    # zo "I'm pissed at myself, Emma. I've got great balance! I don't know what happened out there."
    zo "我是在生自己的气，Emma。我的平衡感一流！不知道刚才在海里怎么回事。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1546
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_61314cb5:

    # em "You'll get it eventually. It takes practice."
    em "你最终会学会的，得多练。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1551
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_c1a6eb15:

    # zo "Yeah, I know you're right... But I'm frustrated with myself."
    zo "嗯，我知道你说得对……但我就是在生自己的气。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1553
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_be4990e7:

    # em "You need to cool off, girl."
    em "你得冷静点，姑娘。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1556
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_31bbfc1b:

    # zo "You did two successful rides. If I knew you better, I'd tell you to shut up."
    zo "你都成功冲了两次。要是跟你再熟点，我肯定叫你闭嘴了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1558
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_be4990e7_1:

    # em "You need to cool off, girl."
    em "你需要冷静点，姑娘。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1560
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_22849a3e:

    # zo "No, thanks. The water was cold enough. I need to get a hot shower and drink a virgin drink in my virgin hostel with all the other virgins."
    zo "不用了，海水已经够凉了。我得洗个热水澡，再回那间清心寡欲的旅舍，跟一群处男处女一起喝无酒精饮料。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1563
translate schinese epi_surf_2nd_label_c8c90a7a:

    # em "No. You go take that shower, and then you'll meet me for a night out. Bret and Jonah are coming, too. It'll be fun!"
    em "不行。你先去洗澡，然后晚上跟我出去玩。Bret和Jonah也来，会很好玩的！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1568
translate schinese epi_bar_label_31b3f9de:

    # zo "{i}Yeah, it would be fun. If I was allowed to drink anything other than milk... Pff...{/i}"
    zo "{i}是啊，肯定很好玩。前提是除了牛奶，还能让我喝点别的……切……{/i}"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1569
translate schinese epi_bar_label_a69f1a4b:

    # zo "{i}I never thought I'd say this, but I was starting to miss sneaking one of Mom's cold beers.{/i}"
    zo "{i}我从没想过会这么说，但开始想念偷喝妈妈冰啤酒的日子了。{/i}"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1571
translate schinese epi_bar_label_04ccab16:

    # em "Zoey! Over here!"
    em "Zoey！这边！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1573
translate schinese epi_bar_label_0708f665:

    # zo "Hey, guys. So, this is the local waterhole of choice?"
    zo "嘿，伙计们。这就是当地人最爱的酒吧？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1575
translate schinese epi_bar_label_cef9191e:

    # jon "It's the only bar in this area that plays our kind of music."
    jon "这是这附近唯一一家放我们这种音乐的酒吧。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1577
translate schinese epi_bar_label_62a2dcee:

    # zo "ShitFaced? No way!"
    zo "ShitFaced？不会吧！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1578
translate schinese epi_bar_label_60bd75a9:

    # bre "You're a fan too?"
    bre "你也喜欢？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1579
translate schinese epi_bar_label_b48df2a5:

    # zo "Um, hell yeah! Since I was like eight and didn't know what it meant."
    zo "当然了！我大概八岁就开始喜欢了，那时还不知道这个名字是什么意思。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1581
translate schinese epi_bar_label_e58eba05:

    # zo "I hate to admit it, but if there is one thing my stepdad did right, it was buying records."
    zo "我不愿承认，不过我继父真做对过一件事，那就是买唱片。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1583
translate schinese epi_bar_label_1f6c4cc0:

    # bt "So what will it be, friends?"
    bt "那你们想点什么，伙计们？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1585
translate schinese epi_bar_label_3d2fed9c:

    # em "The usual."
    em "照旧。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1586
translate schinese epi_bar_label_3c85e358:

    # jon "You know what I like. Surprise me!"
    jon "你知道我喜欢什么，给我个惊喜！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1588
translate schinese epi_bar_label_ddc824bc:

    # zo "I'll have a..."
    zo "我要一杯……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1590
translate schinese epi_bar_label_996fe0ef:

    # bre "Two beers for us!"
    bre "我们来两杯啤酒！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1592
translate schinese epi_bar_label_727a0a8a:

    # bt "You got it."
    bt "好的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1594
translate schinese epi_bar_label_a1ea5dad:

    # bre "How old are you?"
    bre "你多大了？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1596
translate schinese epi_bar_label_b2f4eb70:

    # zo "19..."
    zo "19岁……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1598
translate schinese epi_bar_label_bc0eb0c6:

    # bre "Jeez... Hide that fucking wristband. It's a universal language here."
    bre "操，把那该死的手腕带藏起来。这儿所有人都看得懂这个意思。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1600
translate schinese epi_bar_label_45cd3bc5:

    # jon "Is something universal if it's local?"
    jon "如果只在本地通用，还能叫“通用”吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1602
translate schinese epi_bar_label_96f71fcc:

    # bre "Fuck off, smartass."
    bre "滚开，自作聪明的混蛋。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1604
translate schinese epi_bar_label_90ffa547:

    # zo "I forgot... I have to wear it at the hostel."
    zo "我忘了……我在旅舍里必须戴着它。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1606
translate schinese epi_bar_label_9f4817aa:

    # bre "You live in a hostel?"
    bre "你住在旅舍？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1608
translate schinese epi_bar_label_b88cca8f:

    # jon "That's gotta be expensive."
    jon "那肯定很贵。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1610
translate schinese epi_bar_label_1b644018:

    # zo "It was either a hostel or the street. But I'm looking for a place to rent."
    zo "要么住旅舍，要么睡大街。不过我在找房子租。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1612
translate schinese epi_bar_label_6555ce7d:

    # em "You should look into studio apartments. There are a bunch of them available after the surfing season's over."
    em "你可以看看单间公寓。冲浪季结束后会空出很多。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1614
translate schinese epi_bar_label_252ffddf:

    # zo "And until then?"
    zo "那在冲浪季结束之前呢？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1616
translate schinese epi_bar_label_452fdb0a:

    # jon "You'll have to look harder for one."
    jon "那就得下功夫找了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1618
translate schinese epi_bar_label_2da5016f:

    # zo "So, where do you guys live?"
    zo "那你们住哪儿啊？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1620
translate schinese epi_bar_label_bc3da8df:

    # em "She's scouting us for a place to crash. Quick, think of lies to tell her."
    em "她这是在盘问我们，好找个落脚处。快编点谎话糊弄她。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1622
translate schinese epi_bar_label_40e8b71b:

    # zo "Pff! Was not."
    zo "切！我才没有。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1624
translate schinese epi_bar_label_bd1e16fe:

    # bre "I live above the tattoo studio. You can crash there if you want."
    bre "我住在纹身店楼上，你想的话可以去那儿暂住。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1626
translate schinese epi_bar_label_26c08f1a:

    # em "Aha! Really? You've gotta have it in for Zoey because you never let me do that."
    em "啊哈！真的？你肯定看上Zoey了，你可从没让我住过。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1628
translate schinese epi_bar_label_951e9bff:

    # bre "Ems..."
    bre "艾玛……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1630
translate schinese epi_bar_label_36812ae3:

    # zo "The hostel's cool with me until I find someplace else."
    zo "旅舍暂时住着也行，等我找到别的地方再说。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1632
translate schinese epi_bar_label_14855832:

    # bt "Beers and drinks; here you go."
    bt "啤酒和饮料来啦。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1634
translate schinese epi_bar_label_2375e188:

    # bt "I was gonna say it before, but that's a nice hair color."
    bt "我之前就想说了，你这头发色挺好看的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1635
translate schinese epi_bar_label_277cc651:

    # bt "I've always wanted to try blue, but it's scary taking that leap."
    bt "我一直想尝试蓝色，但迈出这一步还是挺吓人的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1641
translate schinese epi_bar_label_547ca6a0:

    # zo "It's not for everyone."
    zo "不是每个人都适合。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1643
translate schinese epi_bar_label_8a19c4d9:

    # bt "Yeah, and that's what keeps me from doing it."
    bt "对，这就是让我一直没敢去做的原因。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1647
translate schinese epi_bar_label_398aefd4:

    # zo "Just go for it. If it doesn't work out, you can change it again."
    zo "就去试试看。如果不行的话，再换回来也来得及。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1649
translate schinese epi_bar_label_5ebe23de:

    # bt "Haha, that's true!"
    bt "哈哈，那倒是真的！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1651
translate schinese epi_bar_label_386a821e:

    # bre "What the hell? Are you reading tonight?"
    bre "搞什么？你今晚居然在看书？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1653
translate schinese epi_bar_label_941b150a:

    # bre "Entrepreneurial Finance... What the fuck is that?"
    bre "创业金融……这他妈是什么玩意儿？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1654
translate schinese epi_bar_label_4fc3ffd9:

    # jon "You tell me; you pronounced the words right."
    jon "这得问你自己，词都让你念对了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1656
translate schinese epi_bar_label_118fd0bf:

    # em "Wait! Jonah can read? Then why am I the only one doing lettering tattoos?"
    em "等等！Jonah居然识字？那为什么一直只有我做文字纹身？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1658
translate schinese epi_bar_label_a288918f:

    # jon "Because lettering tattoos and tribals are the most boring tattoos you can make."
    jon "因为文字和部落图腾是最无聊的纹身。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1659
translate schinese epi_bar_label_de5258a2:

    # jon "This line of work is my ticket to scoliosis, so I'm not gonna bother with that kind of ink."
    jon "这行迟早让我脊柱侧弯，我才不碰那种图案。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1661
translate schinese epi_bar_label_321bbffb:

    # bre "Seriously, though. What's this for? You going to college or something?"
    bre "说真的，这是干嘛的？你准备去上大学吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1663
translate schinese epi_bar_label_3a856af2:

    # jon "Who knows? I find these things interesting."
    jon "谁知道呢？我觉得这些挺有意思的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1664
translate schinese epi_bar_label_2ccb785b:

    # jon "And maybe if you did too, the studio would be profitable."
    jon "也许你要是也觉得这些有意思，工作室就能赚钱了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1666
translate schinese epi_bar_label_75926b9f:

    # em "Holy fuck, what a nerd burn."
    em "我操，书呆子这一下损得真狠。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1668
translate schinese epi_bar_label_d818d93d:

    # bre "Haha! Sit and spin, fucker!"
    bre "哈哈！坐上去转吧，混蛋！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1669
translate schinese epi_bar_label_c59bf340:

    # bre "Or don't. You'd probably like that."
    bre "算了，你可能正喜欢那样。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1671
translate schinese epi_bar_label_08acf21b:

    # jon "Zoey, help me out here. You're bright. You're going to college someday too, right?"
    jon "Zoey，帮我说句话。你挺聪明，总有一天也会上大学吧？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1676
translate schinese epi_bar_label_68764842:

    # zo "Don't listen to these numbskulls. You do you, Jonah. As for college, I haven't even graduated high school yet."
    zo "别听这些蠢货的。做你自己就好，Jonah。至于大学嘛，我连高中都没毕业呢。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1679
translate schinese epi_bar_label_502d57bf:

    # zo "Dude, I can't defend your choice to bring a book on finance to a rock pub."
    zo "哥们，我真没法帮你解释带本金融书来摇滚酒吧这事儿。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1680
translate schinese epi_bar_label_71736e0e:

    # zo "And I'm not that bright; I haven't even graduated high school yet."
    zo "而且我也没那么聪明；我连高中都没毕业呢。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1682
translate schinese epi_bar_label_41bcc802:

    # em "Kindred spirits!"
    em "同道中人！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1684
translate schinese epi_bar_label_0ba52baf:

    # bre "For real?"
    bre "真的假的？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1686
translate schinese epi_bar_label_9405e606:

    # zo "I flunked my trig class and haven't found the motivation to complete it."
    zo "我三角学没及格，到现在都提不起劲把它补完。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1688
translate schinese epi_bar_label_667bb0a8:

    # jon "That's a bummer."
    jon "真遗憾。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1690
translate schinese epi_bar_label_537a5525:

    # bre "Math! Who needs it?"
    bre "数学！谁需要啊？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1692
translate schinese epi_bar_label_2ba95f06:

    # em "You need it."
    em "你就需要。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1694
translate schinese epi_bar_label_56a2b19c:

    # bre "Oh, please! All you need is a calculator and someone to do your bookkeeping to run a business."
    bre "拜托！经营生意只要有计算器，再找个人替你记账就行。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1696
translate schinese epi_bar_label_bc57f729:

    # bre "Let the number crunchers do their job, and you can do yours."
    bre "让会算账的人干他们的活，你干好自己的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1699
translate schinese epi_bar_label_272cf299:

    # zo "Oh shit! It's this song!"
    zo "哦草！就是这首歌！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1700
translate schinese epi_bar_label_bfd406a3:

    # bre "Huh?"
    bre "嗯？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1702
translate schinese epi_bar_label_4b1af3ef:

    # zo "It's from one of their B-sides! I fucking love it!"
    zo "这是他们B面的一首歌！我他妈超爱！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1704
translate schinese epi_bar_label_9a26dd22:

    # bre "I'm a fan, but I don't know this one."
    bre "我是他们的粉丝，不过没听过这首。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1706
translate schinese epi_bar_label_018a0d6a:

    # zo "Yes, you do!"
    zo "你明明听过！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1708
translate schinese epi_bar_label_dad01511:

    # bre "Nope. I don't know it."
    bre "没有，真没听过。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1710
translate schinese epi_bar_label_13ae149b:

    # zo "But you...do-hahaha!"
    zo "可你明明……听过——哈哈哈！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1712
translate schinese epi_bar_label_9bc805c2:

    # em "Did she get a beer or one of your umbrella drinks?"
    em "她喝的是啤酒，还是你那种带小伞的鸡尾酒？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1714
translate schinese epi_bar_label_0b140a53:

    # jon "Drink-shame me all you want, but these are delicious. You wish you were girl enough to order one."
    jon "随你们怎么笑我喝这种酒，它们就是好喝。你巴不得自己也够娘们儿，敢点上一杯。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1716
translate schinese epi_bar_label_fc5a186a:

    # bre "What's so funny?"
    bre "有什么好笑的？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1718
translate schinese epi_bar_label_03625e26:

    # zo "Haha! It's nothing - just an inside joke thingy."
    zo "哈哈哈！没啥，就是个内部笑话啦。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1728
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d2be5493:

    # bre "It's straight, right?"
    bre "这条线是直的，对吧？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1729
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d8ec66ae:

    # jon "Straighter than me."
    jon "比我还直。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1731
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_271d7416:

    # em "Yeah, it looks fine."
    em "看起来没问题。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1734
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_6a98bf44:

    # bre "You didn't drink anything today or yesterday?"
    bre "你今天和昨天都没喝酒吧？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1738
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_68a0db31:

    # zo "Is that a problem?"
    zo "这有啥问题？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1740
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_dc2da7a6:

    # bre "You're gonna bleed like a pig if you did."
    bre "你要是喝了的话，肯定跟猪一样流血。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1742
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d97c7a4d:

    # zo "Ok. I didn't drink anything."
    zo "好，我什么都没喝。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1744
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_e1012bae:

    # zo "Not alcohol, no."
    zo "酒精饮料没喝。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1746
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_666d5a57:

    # bre "Good. Since it's your first one, I'm gonna push you down a bit harder when I start."
    bre "好。既然是第一次，刚开始时我会把你按得紧一点。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1748
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_4a10b8a9:

    # zo "Huh?"
    zo "嗯？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1750
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_c6b5a699:

    # bre "We do it all the time with the newbies. I don't know how you'll react to the needle, and I don't want you to jerk so I mess up the line."
    bre "第一次纹身的人都得这样。我不知道你对针会有什么反应，可不想你突然一动，害我把线纹歪。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1752
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ebe8df68:

    # zo "Ok... Does it hurt, though?"
    zo "那……会疼吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1754
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_4a3ac897:

    # em "Think of it as pressing a knife against your skin and slowly dragging it back and forth."
    em "把它想象成把刀贴在皮肤上，然后慢慢来回拖动。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1756
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_bed83ef0:

    # zo "Uh... That sounds like it would hurt a lot."
    zo "嗯……听起来会很疼吧。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1758
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_91a52ddc:

    # em "No, not that kind of a knife. A cutlery knife, you know?"
    em "不，不是那种刀。是餐刀，明白吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1760
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_5b7adb43:

    # zo "Yeah, but still-"
    zo "嗯，但还是——"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1763
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_4135ec96:

    # zo "Ah! Shit! That startled me!"
    zo "啊！见鬼！我被吓了一跳！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1764
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_3ab3a464:

    # zo "Hngn! Hey..."
    zo "嗯！喂……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1766
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_5395b020:

    # zo "Ok, it's not too bad."
    zo "好吧，还不算太疼。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1768
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_62639bb1:

    # bre "Are you good?"
    bre "你没事吧？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1770
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_cecb8359:

    # zo "Yeah."
    zo "嗯。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1772
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0304fea3:

    # bre "The needle will hurt more when I go against the bones - just a heads up."
    bre "针碰到骨头附近会更疼——先提醒你一下。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1774
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_6507b54a:

    # zo "Ok."
    zo "好的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1776
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_1f87a53f:

    # bre "So, who's the tattoo for?"
    bre "那这个纹身是纪念谁的？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1778
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_7f02b4f1:

    # zo "It's something I drew."
    zo "是我画的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1780
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_10d42497:

    # bre "Yeah? What about the text? It's kind of morbid."
    bre "嗯？那文字呢？有点阴暗。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1781
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_f9cdd509:

    # bre "\"Your wings were ready, but my heart was not.\""
    bre "你的翅膀已经准备好了，可我的心还没准备好。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1783
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_64b7a840:

    # zo "It's for my grandma. I don't wanna talk about her when we're doing this."
    zo "是纪念我外婆的。纹的时候我不想谈她。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1784
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_9fb45d0f:

    # zo "It won't be the needle that makes me cry if we do."
    zo "真聊起来，让我哭的可就不是针了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1786
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_31fc81a0:

    # bre "Gotcha. I wanted to do a tattoo like this for my dog, but I never did. Damn, I miss that mutt."
    bre "明白。我以前也想为我的狗纹一个这样的，可一直没纹。妈的，我真想念那只狗。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1788
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_19079c85:

    # zo "Never got another dog?"
    zo "你之后还养过别的狗吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1790
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_08185ffd:

    # bre "No. I couldn't bring myself to get one."
    bre "没。我没办法再养一只。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1791
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_5256f708:

    # bre "I don't wanna go through that pain ever again. It was way worse than losing a relative."
    bre "我不想再经历那种痛苦了。那感觉比失去亲人还要糟。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1792
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_92de2762:

    # bre "But maybe that says more about my family than it does about my dog."
    bre "但也许这更多说明了我的家庭，而不是我的狗。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1794
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_c43061e1:

    # zo "I wouldn't know. I never had any pets."
    zo "我不知道。我从来没养过宠物。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1797
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_af894861:

    # bre "Bone."
    bre "骨头。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1798
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d9647b01:

    # zo "Ouch!"
    zo "哎哟！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1799
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_30698b7a:

    # zo "Yeah, that hurts..."
    zo "对，真疼……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1801
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_31d75934:

    # em "I'm heading home. You'll be ok without me?"
    em "我得回去了，你没我也能行？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1803
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ccd4bb59:

    # bre "Jonah's still here, ain't he?"
    bre "Jonah还在呢，不是吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1805
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0568ffe2:

    # jon "I'm leaving too."
    jon "我也走了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1807
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_b529fbb7:

    # bre "What is this? Half-day Friday?"
    bre "怎么回事？周五只上半天班？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1809
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_52617899:

    # jon "Whatever you say, workaholic!"
    jon "随便你，工作狂！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1811
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_7540424f:

    # bre "Flip the sign and lock the door, will you?"
    bre "把牌子翻过来，再把门锁上，行吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1813
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_20828e86:

    # zo "You're staying extra for me?"
    zo "你是为了我多留一会儿吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1815
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_a3429597:

    # bre "I don't mind it. You've done such a great job, so I thought you'd earned this."
    bre "没关系。你干得这么好，我觉得你配得上这个纹身。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1817
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ca5b362a:

    # zo "That's not a way to weasel out of paying me, I hope."
    zo "希望你不是想靠这个逃掉我的工资。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1819
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_bed420d0:

    # bre "Haha! Not really. I thought we could extend your hours a bit."
    bre "哈哈！当然不是。我想把你的工时再延长一点。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1820
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_496e2b80:

    # bre "Customers have been diggin' your work. I tattooed two of your stencils this week."
    bre "顾客很喜欢你的作品。这周我用了你画的两张图样。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1822
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ecbf4ba2:

    # zo "Whoa, that's so cool."
    zo "哇，这太酷了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1823
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0823a4c5:

    # zo "Isn't it an odd feeling that you get paid to scar people for life?"
    zo "这感觉不怪吗？你靠给人留下一辈子的伤疤来赚钱？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1824
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_f9cfcc59:

    # zo "Like, right now, there are a bunch of people walking around with things I drew on a piece of paper."
    zo "现在有好多人都带着我纸上画的东西到处走。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1825
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ed5fbb65:

    # zo "They liked it so much that they wanted it permanently on their skin... It's sick, right?"
    zo "他们喜欢到想永远留在皮肤上……太酷了，对吧？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1826
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_dc3329a2:

    # bre "It's just a piece of skin. People put too much value on their bodies."
    bre "不过是一块皮肤而已。人们太看重自己的身体了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1827
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_6a533a4f:

    # zo "Well, we only get one body."
    zo "可人只有一副身体。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1828
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_6bb5e7a5:

    # bre "Are you having second thoughts about this tattoo? Because it's kind of too late for that."
    bre "你是不是开始后悔这个纹身了？因为现在说后悔已经有点晚了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1830
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_796b57e7:

    # zo "Haha, no. I guess what I wanted to say is that it's...pretty cool. The work you do."
    zo "哈哈，不是。我想说的其实是，你这活儿挺酷的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1831
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_04def60e:

    # zo "You're creating walking pieces of art."
    zo "你是在制造行走的艺术品。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1833
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_c797f1be:

    # bre "It's the only work I know how to do. I bought my first tattoo gun when I was 14."
    bre "这是我唯一会做的工作。我14岁时就买了第一台纹身机。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1834
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_899c9c13:

    # bre "My older brother helped me get one."
    bre "我哥帮我买到的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1835
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_cae67b18:

    # bre "Ems and I started making shitty tattoos on each other for practice."
    bre "我和艾玛一开始就互相纹些烂图案练手。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1840
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_1cd3af6d:

    # zo "I can tell. Those tattoos on your hands are horrible."
    zo "我能看出来。你手上的纹身可真难看。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1842
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_253956b2:

    # bre "What? I was talking about the ones on my legs."
    bre "什么？我刚才说的可是腿上的那些。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1844
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_1d20932d:

    # zo "Oh..."
    zo "哦……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1845
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_655526b0:

    # zo "Is it pointless trying to undo the damage?"
    zo "现在想挽回伤害还有意义吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1847
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_c9726242:

    # bre "Yeah, and I already pegged you as a straight shooter."
    bre "对，而且我早看出你是个直肠子。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1848
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_6156da79:

    # bre "Not everyone tells you how it is to your face, you know?"
    bre "不是每个人都会当面告诉你真相，你知道吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1850
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_182bac5b:

    # zo "At least you get to wear gloves when you work."
    zo "至少你工作时还能戴着手套。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1852
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_e4267637:

    # bre "Yeah, you can always cover your tattoos up if you want to. Most of them, anyway."
    bre "对，想遮总能遮住。至少大多数可以。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1856
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d411a24e:

    # zo "Which ones?"
    zo "哪些？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1858
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_5fc6c939:

    # bre "The ones on my legs. They are just legs, and you can cover the tattoos with pants if you want to."
    bre "我腿上那些。就只是腿而已，如果你想的话，穿裤子就能遮住纹身。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1860
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_725d9e55:

    # zo "Not with the kind of pants you're wearing."
    zo "就你穿的这种裤子可遮不住。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1862
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_842f10b4:

    # bre "Haha, I'll give you that one."
    bre "哈哈，我承认你赢了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1864
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_e25162d3:

    # zo "You're making me feel better about getting tattoos... Thanks."
    zo "你让我更想继续纹身了……谢谢。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1866
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_88a68248:

    # bre "Ask Ems and Jonah, and I'm sure they'll do a couple for you too. If you're looking to get more, I mean."
    bre "问问艾玛和Jonah，他们肯定也愿意给你纹几个。我是说，如果你还想继续纹的话。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1868
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ddf631dd:

    # zo "I gotta say that the feeling is pretty nice. It hurts, but I kind of like it."
    zo "我得说这感觉还挺爽的。疼是疼，但我还挺喜欢这种感觉的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1870
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_db092bea:

    # bre "Yeah, that sounds like someone who wants to get more of 'em for sure."
    bre "听起来你肯定还想再纹几个。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1871
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_fb829c84:

    # bre "The pain is half the experience."
    bre "痛感才是体验的一半。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1873
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_659e10db:

    # zo "Haha, that's so dark..."
    zo "哈哈，这可真够阴暗的……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1875
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_2e965644:

    # bre "Just like anal."
    bre "就像肛交一样。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1877
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_9307c51a:

    # zo "Uh..."
    zo "呃……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1879
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_b20a7fee:

    # bre "Too far, haha. Sorry, I have shitty humor."
    bre "太过了，哈哈。抱歉，我这幽默真差。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1880
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_fd4b9b5e:

    # bre "But it's true. You'll see."
    bre "但这是真的，你很快就会明白。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1882
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_4cf62061:

    # zo "I hope you're still talking about tattoos."
    zo "希望你还在说纹身。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1884
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_3c27972b:

    # bre "So, do you got a boyfriend back in...wherever it was you came from?"
    bre "所以，你老家那边有男朋友吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1886
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_b6023f7d:

    # zo "Huh? Uh..."
    zo "嗯？呃……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1887
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_41df2ba7:

    # zo "Did you just segue from talking about anal to asking if I have a boyfriend?"
    zo "你刚才是不是从聊肛交直接跳到问我有没有男朋友？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1889
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_6e70c37b:

    # bre "Innocent question. I swear."
    bre "只是个单纯的问题，我发誓。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1891
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_fd0019b1:

    # zo "Well, there's this guy, but I don't know..."
    zo "嗯，有个家伙，但我不确定……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1892
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_8c443f72:

    # zo "Lately, it's been kind of weird between us."
    zo "最近我们之间有点怪怪的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1894
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ef64a414:

    # zo "I think he blames me a bit for leaving too fast."
    zo "我觉得他有点怪我走得太仓促。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1895
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_b914f12d:

    # zo "We talked about going places together for a while, you know, after graduating."
    zo "我们曾聊过毕业后一起去外面闯荡。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1896
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0e7597fb:

    # zo "But he's still in school and couldn't come here with me, and I had to come here for...myself."
    zo "但他还在念书，没法跟我一起来，而我来这里……是为了我自己。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1898
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_a37ea31a:

    # bre "Sounds complicated."
    bre "听起来挺复杂的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1900
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_dbba0b5e:

    # zo "Not really. He's as simple as they get."
    zo "不，他挺简单的，没什么复杂的地方。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1902
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_f199ac90:

    # bre "Oof... I'd kill myself if a girlfriend described me like that."
    bre "嚯……女朋友要这么形容我，我还不如死了算了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1904
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ff836d62:

    # zo "It's not an insult. He's pretty much drama-free."
    zo "这可不是贬义。他几乎没什么烦心事。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1905
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_09d9ed7e:

    # zo "We'd been best friends for years before we started to...you know."
    zo "我们做了好多年最好的朋友，后来才开始……你懂的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1907
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_3d336864:

    # bre "Know what?"
    bre "开始什么？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1912
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_6a1bbab8:

    # zo "Fuck."
    zo "操。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1915
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_db72e09b:

    # zo "Discover our bodies."
    zo "探索彼此的身体。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1917
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_785bd2d2:

    # bre "I hear you. That sounds like Ems and me."
    bre "懂了。听起来就像我和艾玛。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1919
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_5eb6b26c:

    # zo "You and Ems? Are you...together?"
    zo "你和艾玛？你们……在一起过？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1921
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_dd3c3908:

    # bre "Not anymore. It's been a while."
    bre "现在不是了。已经有一段时间了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1922
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d5d533b5:

    # bre "I set up the studio while she went off doing her things in Vegas. We eventually got back together for work, but that's it."
    bre "她去拉斯维加斯做自己的事时，我开了这间工作室。后来我们又因为工作走到一起，但仅此而已。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1923
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_22ef1a18:

    # bre "We're still best friends, though."
    bre "我们还是最好的朋友。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1925
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_8e9f7e19:

    # zo "I get the feeling I'm drifting apart from...him."
    zo "我感觉我和他之间正在慢慢疏远。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1926
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_b1a6a6ec:

    # zo "He's pretty short in his messages to me. He doesn't seem to share my joy."
    zo "他回消息很冷淡，似乎也不为我高兴。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1928
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_f36f7056:

    # bre "If he got bummed out when you left, can you blame him?"
    bre "如果他因为你离开而难过，你还能怪他吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1930
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d939615f:

    # zo "Um, yeah? He's my best friend."
    zo "嗯，是啊？他是我最好的朋友。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1932
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_3a4ae3ad:

    # bre "See it like this... If he was something more than that, then maybe he's having a harder time getting over you than you have getting over him."
    bre "换个角度想……如果他对你不只是朋友，也许他比你更难放下这段感情。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1934
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_077a841a:

    # zo "Getting over each other? No, you've got it wrong. We weren't in a relationship. We are best friends who happened to fuck a lot."
    zo "放下彼此？不，你理解错了。我们没谈恋爱，只是碰巧经常上床的好朋友。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1936
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_f22847ea:

    # bre "You agreed on that?"
    bre "你们说好了？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1938
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_cd316bde:

    # zo "It was more of a silent agreement. The kind that you understood with time. I fucking hate talking about feelings."
    zo "更像是心照不宣的默契，时间久了自然就明白了。我他妈最讨厌谈感情。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1939
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_7f789214:

    # zo "And he's a bit of a softie at times. That makes me uncomfortable."
    zo "而且他有时很容易动感情，让我觉得不自在。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1941
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_e536b8e9:

    # bre "All right... And then you left before ending it with him?"
    bre "好吧……所以你没跟他把关系说清楚就走了？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1943
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_bb5bf8ec:

    # zo "Yeah? So?"
    zo "对啊，怎么了？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1945
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_a2d82a17:

    # bre "You know what? It's not my place to say these things to you. I only speak from my own experience when Ems left me for a while."
    bre "算了，这些话不该由我对你说。我只是想起艾玛当初离开我一阵子的经历。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1947
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0372604a:

    # zo "..."
    zo "……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1949
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_2ac16f6d:

    # zo "How was it for you when that happened?"
    zo "那件事发生时你感觉怎么样？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1951
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_f5ad023d:

    # bre "I could have handled it better."
    bre "我本可以处理得更好。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1952
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_8f840fd2:

    # bre "I got drunk and drunk-texted her. That only made it worse."
    bre "我喝醉后给她发消息，结果只让事情变得更糟。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1953
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_a0d05114:

    # bre "When I sobered up, I realized I had to stop doing that, so I did."
    bre "当我清醒过来时，我意识到必须停止这样做了，所以我就停了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1954
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ccb6b7da:

    # bre "I feared the damage was already done, though. She didn't write me anything for a long time."
    bre "我担心伤害已经造成了，她有一段时间都没给我发过消息。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1956
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_2a741d7b:

    # bre "She gave me a like or two on Rooster once in a while. Hit me up with some short comments. But for the better part of it, she stayed away."
    bre "她偶尔在我发的Rooster下点个赞，发些简短的评论。但大部分时间，她都保持距离。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1957
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_e62373b6:

    # bre "It's not something a best friend would do, but she actually did me a favor. It allowed me to get over her and focus on work."
    bre "这可不是普通朋友会做的事，但她其实帮我了个大忙。让我终于能放下了，也把精力放回工作上。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1959
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d9a5079f:

    # zo "What happened after she came back?"
    zo "她回来之后发生了什么？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1961
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_009edb00:

    # bre "Believe it or not, it was like pressing play on your favorite ShitFaced song that you paused for a long time."
    bre "信不信由你，那就像重新播放一首暂停了很久、你最爱的ShitFaced歌曲。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1962
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_a717a908:

    # bre "The song was as good, if not even better, than before."
    bre "那首歌还是那么好听，甚至比以前更好听。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1964
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_df8a5c32:

    # bre "We didn't really talk about our hookups or get back together in any other way than friends - and, well, co-workers."
    bre "我们没怎么谈以前上床的事，也没复合——只是朋友，还有同事。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1965
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_83d0a099:

    # bre "Knowing how it turned out, I owe her a lot for doing what she did to me. I think it saved me in a sense."
    bre "知道结果之后，我真的很感激她当初对我做的事。我觉得她那番举动，某种程度上救了我。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1968
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0372604a_1:

    # zo "..."
    zo "……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1971
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0e2038b5:

    # bre "Ok... I think you'll like this. Are you ready to see the new you?"
    bre "好了……我想你会喜欢这个。准备好看看新的你了吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1973
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_69897a4f:

    # zo "Yeah, I'm dying to. It started to hurt a lot more toward the end."
    zo "对，我都等不及了。后面疼得厉害多了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1975
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_1aa43b3d:

    # bre "Yeah, the adrenaline wears off after this long of a session."
    bre "纹了这么久，肾上腺素的劲儿早就过去了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1977
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_cd85e84d:

    # bre "What do you think?"
    bre "你觉得怎么样？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1979
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0372604a_2:

    # zo "..."
    zo "……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1981
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_8560b3aa:

    # zo "I love it."
    zo "我喜欢。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1983
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_8dde8e92:

    # bre "I can tell."
    bre "看得出来。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1985
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_126a6c60:

    # zo "Grandma would have loved this..."
    zo "外婆肯定也会喜欢这个……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1987
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_3b7eceb2:

    # bre "She sounds like a cool grandma."
    bre "听起来你外婆是个很酷的人。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1989
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_98e5f9f3:

    # zo "Yeah... She's the reason I'm here today."
    zo "是啊……正因为她，我今天才会来到这里。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1990
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_f270ede1:

    # zo "She wanted me to... *{i}Sobs{/i}*"
    zo "她想让我……*{i}抽泣{/i}*"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1991
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_56e72d7a:

    # zo "...go my own way through life..."
    zo "……按照自己的方式过一生……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1992
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_76616419:

    # zo "...and not listen to what everyone else wanted for me."
    zo "……而且不听从别人对我人生的安排。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1993
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_e75491c1:

    # zo "She passed away before she got to see me do it."
    zo "她没能亲眼看到我这样做，就去世了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1995
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_bd498879:

    # bre "That's rough..."
    bre "那可真够惨的……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1997
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_6a62a09f:

    # bre "Come with me. Let's put some plastic on that tattoo and get a drink."
    bre "跟我来，咱们先给那纹身贴个塑料膜，然后再去喝点东西。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:1998
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_8ea22d7e:

    # bre "You shouldn't drink after you get tattooed, but one beer won't hurt."
    bre "你刚纹完身就不该喝酒，但一杯啤酒应该没关系。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2011
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_268b7ce6:

    # zo "What the fuck am I doing here, Bret?"
    zo "我他妈在这里干什么，Bret？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2013
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0316f71a:

    # bre "I ask myself that question every day."
    bre "我每天都在问自己这个问题。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2015
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_dba3f141:

    # zo "You've got something going on here. You've got your business, your own place, and your friends."
    zo "你已经拥有一些东西了。事业、自己的住处，还有朋友。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2017
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_be142e0a:

    # bre "It took me a lifetime to get here, and I'm still stuck where life began."
    bre "我花了大半辈子走到今天，却仍困在自己出生的地方。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2018
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_b12aa479:

    # bre "If I were brave like you, I'd leave it all behind for something new, too."
    bre "如果我像你一样勇敢，我也会把一切抛在脑后，去追寻新的东西。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2020
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_12a29156:

    # bre "When you get stuck in a place for too long..."
    bre "你待在一个地方太久……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2021
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_f35044ce:

    # bre "You lose the will to do something about it."
    bre "就会渐渐没了改变现状的意愿。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2022
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_924a6d1e:

    # bre "Every day, it's the same thing."
    bre "每天都是老一套。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2024
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_73f31b16:

    # bre "Wake up, eat, shit, shower..."
    bre "醒来，吃饭，拉屎，洗澡……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2025
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_7f65680b:

    # bre "...rub one out..."
    bre "……撸上一发……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2026
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_9be19608:

    # bre "Head down one floor and sit hunched over strangers."
    bre "下一层楼，弓着腰在陌生人身上干活。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2027
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_29b48424:

    # bre "My back is killing me, my posture is becoming shit, and the money will last month-to-month with a little icing on the top."
    bre "我的背快散架了，体态也越来越糟，赚的钱只够月月开销，稍微还能剩一点。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2029
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_e8eca6fb:

    # bre "*{i}Scoffs{/i}*"
    bre "*{i}嗤笑{/i}*"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2031
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_c4374b7f:

    # bre "And what scares me the most about it..."
    bre "而且最让我害怕的是……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2032
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_e3cf779a:

    # bre "I think this is as good as it will get."
    bre "我觉得这已经算是最好的了。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2034
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_5287b658:

    # bre "I think that right now, at this very moment... These are my golden years."
    bre "我觉得现在，就在这当下……这些就是我的黄金岁月。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2035
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d4e5409c:

    # bre "Ten years from now, I will reminisce about when I sat on my rooftop drinking beer with a blue-haired teenager, talking about life."
    bre "十年后，我会回忆起坐在屋顶喝啤酒、和一个蓝发少女聊人生的时光。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2036
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_8e812797:

    # bre "And I will call it \"the good old days\"."
    bre "我会称之为“曾经的美好时光”。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2038
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ecaffd10:

    # bre "Of course, Jonah will be long since gone. He'll have left us for whatever he wants to do with his life."
    bre "当然，Jonah到那时早就走了。他会离开我们，去追求自己想要的人生。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2039
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_cff8e0c1:

    # bre "He's the smartest guy I know - but don't tell him I told you that because I will deny ever having said it. Haha..."
    bre "他是我认识的最聪明的人——但别告诉他我跟你说过这话，因为我肯定会否认说过。哈哈……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2040
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_a05df18c:

    # bre "He's so talented too. I can't believe he works with me. But it won't be for long..."
    bre "他也很有才华。我真不敢相信他能和我一起工作。但这种情况不会持续太久……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2042
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_46908685:

    # bre "And Ems... Ems... I don't know what she wants or where she's going."
    bre "还有艾玛……艾玛……我不知道她想要什么，也不知道她要去哪里。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2043
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_60db9eda:

    # bre "I used to think she wanted me, and now she talks about everything but me."
    bre "我以前以为她想要我，现在她什么都谈，唯独不谈我。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2044
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_c2841b6b:

    # bre "I think it's some kind of identity crisis..."
    bre "我觉得她大概陷入了某种身份认同危机……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2045
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_fb455883:

    # bre "...I'm probably having one too."
    bre "……我可能也正经历着同样的危机。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2047
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_ef58d0e4:

    # bre "Because..."
    bre "因为……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2048
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_49e5f95d:

    # bre "...what the fuck am I doing here, Zoey?"
    bre "……我他妈在这里干什么，Zoey？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2050
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_52e2fe76:

    # zo "To me... It sounds like you're living life."
    zo "在我看来……你只是在好好生活。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2051
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0f208992:

    # zo "You have this place with a beautiful view and the ocean breeze at night..."
    zo "你这儿有这么个地方，风景优美，晚上还能感受到海风……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2053
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d3f75855:

    # zo "If I could bottle a smell... *{i}Inhales{/i}*"
    zo "如果能把一种气味装进瓶子……*{i}吸气{/i}*"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2054
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0e21d189:

    # zo "...this would be it."
    zo "……我会选这个味道。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2056
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_8278a35b:

    # zo "And you get to wake up to sunshine every morning."
    zo "你每天早上都能醒来，看到阳光。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2057
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_532b4227:

    # zo "And get this... If you wanna go take a swim, you have the largest fucking ocean in the world a five-minute walk away."
    zo "而且你想想，想游泳的话，走五分钟就是他妈全世界最大的海洋。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2058
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_c01b530a:

    # zo "Or seven minutes if you're wearing those tight shorts."
    zo "或者你穿着那些紧身短裤的话，得七分钟。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2060
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_d28db9da:

    # zo "You also get to work with what you love and what you're good at. And you really are good at it!"
    zo "你还能做着自己热爱且擅长的事情，而且你真的很擅长这行！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2061
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_62bf4da9:

    # zo "Sure, it seems like your body won't like your job in time, but that can be said about almost any job, can't it?"
    zo "当然，长期干下去你的身体可能会吃不消，但几乎每种工作都这样，不是吗？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2062
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_cf73f204:

    # zo "To me, it sounds like you suffer from home blindness."
    zo "在我看来，你只是陷入了“家乡盲区”。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2064
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_4a0fc236:

    # bre "Haha... Home blindness... Did Ems teach you that one?"
    bre "哈哈……“家乡盲区”……这是艾玛教你的？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2066
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_b9e1cb86:

    # zo "She did."
    zo "是她教的。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2067
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_35758a75:

    # bre "..."
    bre "……"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2069
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_1d2ad0cb:

    # bre "It's a good fucking expression."
    bre "这说法他妈真贴切。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2071
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_9020f4b4:

    # bre "*{i}Inhales{/i}*"
    bre "*{i}吸气{/i}*"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2073
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_0f1f1611:

    # bre "*{i}Exhales{/i}*"
    bre "*{i}呼气{/i}*"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2075
translate schinese epi_tattoo_label_04a677dc:

    # bre "You're right... This is a great place to be."
    bre "你说得对……这里真是个好地方。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2092
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_ac06352d:

    # mc "I'm telling you, I don't know how to draw!"
    mc "都跟你说了，我根本不会画！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2094
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_888280c2:

    # zo "But you do!"
    zo "但你会！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2096
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_d268f597:

    # mc "Haha! I don't!"
    mc "哈哈！我可不会！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2098
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_7938c2c3:

    # zo "Can't you at least try? For me?"
    zo "你就不能试试吗？就当为了我？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2100
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_35b18020:

    # mc "You know I'm gonna end up ruining another page."
    mc "你知道我肯定又要毁掉一页纸。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2102
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_577e0fd4:

    # zo "Ruin away!"
    zo "尽管毁！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2104
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_27d34f66:

    # mc "What do you want me to draw?"
    mc "你想让我画什么？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2106
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_20e44d7c:

    # zo "Whatever comes to mind!"
    zo "想到什么画什么！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2107
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_3d77c047:

    # mc "Um... I'm drawing a blank."
    mc "嗯……我脑子里一片空白。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2109
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_29408d96:

    # zo "How about if I play the guitar, and you draw me playing it?"
    zo "那我来弹吉他，你画我弹吉他的样子怎么样？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2111
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_316816f6:

    # mc "You can't play the guitar."
    mc "你又不会弹吉他。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2113
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_fac422eb:

    # zo "I can! And you can draw!"
    zo "我会！你也会画！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2114
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_4bbc8e06:

    # mc "We're probably at the same level, me with the pen and you with the guitar."
    mc "我们大概水平相当，我拿笔，你拿吉他。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2116
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_791bc0c7:

    # zo "I think we're both better than we think!"
    zo "我觉得我们俩都比自己想象的强！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2117
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_e276075b:

    # zo "Now, how do you play this fucking thing?"
    zo "现在，这玩意儿他妈到底怎么弹？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2119
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_0c737b02:

    # mc "You don't know any chords?"
    mc "你连和弦都不懂？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2120
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_53520905:

    # zo "Dude, it all looks the same to me."
    zo "哥们，这玩意儿在我眼里都一个样。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2122
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_6b8095ec:

    # zo "You curl up your hand to make it look like my nana's hand, and somehow you make beautiful sounds."
    zo "你把手指蜷起来，弄得像我外婆的手，结果居然还能发出好听的声音。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2124
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_1f4909a3:

    # zo "It shouldn't be so hard... Like... This!"
    zo "这不应该这么难……就像……这个！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2125
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_5458cc27:

    # mc "Haha, what the fuck even is that?"
    mc "哈哈，那他妈是什么和弦？"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2126
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_2932190f:

    # zo "It's the Z-chord!"
    zo "这是Z和弦！"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2127
translate schinese epi_hostel_label_b7b53ac8:

    # mc "You do know your music."
    mc "你果然懂音乐。"

# episode_interlude\episode_interlude.rpy:2129
